\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 Uyghur}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2  separatist demonstration in Paris. With that, Haitiwaji \u8212  a mother in her 50s \u8212  is accused of fraternizing with terrorists and sent to a re-education camp. One fellow detainee \u8220 was accused of selling banned religious CDs,\u8221  Haitiwaji recalls. \u8220 Still others had attended a wedding where no alcohol had been served.\u8221  The }
{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 women}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
